@@@!atrep

@@/ at-poesia: the poetry pack - verse blocks (stichoi
@@/ grammata, strophes, the optional title and attribution)
@@/ and the composition date poems sign with.
@@/ Part of the standard library; composes with koine and its
@@/ sibling packs.

@=== verse
@~ [lemma]
stichos
~@ [hypograph]
@"verse block"@
@""
Stichoi grammata: line breaks are significant, blank lines
separate strophes, leading spaces are authorial content. The
lemma is the poem title (omit for untitled poems); the
hypograph is the composition date or attribution.
""@
===@

@=== composition-date
@-/ grammata /-@
@"composition date at the end of stories or letters"@
@""
Own paragraph. Poems use the verse hypograph instead.
""@
===@
